1
00:01:03,396 --> 00:01:05,356
My God, save us!

2
00:01:05,440 --> 00:01:07,067
What is this?

3
00:01:07,609 --> 00:01:09,903
How terrifying!

4
00:01:13,656 --> 00:01:15,950
He's coming!

5
00:01:16,034 --> 00:01:17,035
Sister Clara?

6
00:01:19,079 --> 00:01:20,121
Sister Clara?

7
00:01:24,459 --> 00:01:25,835
What's happening?

8
00:01:28,713 --> 00:01:32,091
Don't let the devil get to you!

9
00:03:14,819 --> 00:03:19,240
Matthew 26:41.

10
00:03:19,324 --> 00:03:20,825
Watch and pray.

11
00:03:20,909 --> 00:03:23,578
So that you may not fall into temptation.

12
00:03:27,790 --> 00:03:29,876
<i>The spirit is willing,</i>

13
00:03:29,959 --> 00:03:32,962
<i>but the flesh is weak.</i>

14
00:03:33,046 --> 00:03:38,551
<i>Prayer is our only weapon</i>
<i>against the forces of darkness.</i>

15
00:03:43,514 --> 00:03:46,142
<i>In times of your weakness,</i>

16
00:03:46,768 --> 00:03:48,895
<i>the devil will visit</i>

17
00:03:48,978 --> 00:03:51,356
<i>and play with you.</i>

18
00:04:04,202 --> 00:04:05,954
<i>Prayer,</i>

19
00:04:06,037 --> 00:04:07,830
<i>penance,</i>

20
00:04:07,914 --> 00:04:09,457
<i>and sacrifice.</i>

21
00:04:09,540 --> 00:04:11,251
<i>These are your weapons.</i>

22
00:04:12,126 --> 00:04:14,170
<i>Fight against sin,</i>

23
00:04:14,254 --> 00:04:16,464
<i>the weakness of the flesh,</i>

24
00:04:16,547 --> 00:04:17,966
<i>and the seven deadly sins which are,</i>

25
00:04:18,925 --> 00:04:19,801
<i>pride,</i>

26
00:04:19,884 --> 00:04:21,302
<i>envy,</i>

27
00:04:21,386 --> 00:04:22,679
<i>gluttony,</i>

28
00:04:22,762 --> 00:04:24,389
<i>sloth,</i>

29
00:04:24,472 --> 00:04:26,015
<i>lust,</i>

30
00:04:26,099 --> 00:04:27,058
<i>wrath</i>

31
00:04:27,141 --> 00:04:28,810
<i>and greed.</i>

32
00:04:30,186 --> 00:04:32,313
<i>Cleanse your soul.</i>

33
00:04:32,981 --> 00:04:34,857
<i>Otherwise,</i>

34
00:04:35,483 --> 00:04:38,361
<i>the darkness will come upon you.</i>

35
00:04:53,751 --> 00:04:55,336
Sister Rosa?

36
00:05:04,387 --> 00:05:06,514
My apologies, Sister Piedad.

37
00:05:10,601 --> 00:05:13,438
What's this? Where did you get it?

38
00:05:15,898 --> 00:05:19,110
The workers brought it from the pier.

39
00:05:19,193 --> 00:05:20,737
Maybe…

40
00:05:20,820 --> 00:05:24,532
it's a donation for the convent
from the sunken galleon.

41
00:05:26,576 --> 00:05:28,077
A donation?

42
00:05:30,288 --> 00:05:33,916
Or maybe it is trash from Mexico?

43
00:05:41,049 --> 00:05:42,467
Sister Rosa?

44
00:05:58,900 --> 00:06:02,820
<i>Come here. Open this.</i>

45
00:06:24,842 --> 00:06:27,303
The devil has come!

46
00:06:27,386 --> 00:06:29,180
Listen to me!

47
00:06:29,263 --> 00:06:31,307
He is here!

48
00:06:31,390 --> 00:06:33,935
Let me go!

49
00:06:34,894 --> 00:06:36,938
The devil has come!

50
00:06:37,021 --> 00:06:40,733
He is here! The devil has come!

51
00:07:01,671 --> 00:07:04,507
I'm Ana. What's your name?

52
00:07:04,590 --> 00:07:05,883
Flor.

53
00:07:15,351 --> 00:07:17,228
Who are you looking for?

54
00:07:17,979 --> 00:07:19,188
My older sister, Clara.

55
00:07:19,272 --> 00:07:22,150
You have a sister here in the convent?

56
00:07:22,233 --> 00:07:23,860
You're both lucky.

57
00:07:23,943 --> 00:07:26,487
You two serve our God.

58
00:07:26,571 --> 00:07:29,449
Is your sister the reason why you're here?

59
00:07:30,658 --> 00:07:33,327
This is my punishment from my father

60
00:07:33,411 --> 00:07:36,456
when he found out that my boyfriend
and I were going to elope.

61
00:07:56,893 --> 00:07:58,644
That's forbidden!

62
00:07:58,728 --> 00:08:01,481
Hide it! We might get scolded.

63
00:08:03,608 --> 00:08:05,234
I'm sorry.

64
00:08:05,318 --> 00:08:09,071
But whenever I feel sad or scared,

65
00:08:09,155 --> 00:08:10,573
I get hungry.

66
00:08:10,656 --> 00:08:11,657
Mother of God!

67
00:08:13,075 --> 00:08:16,746
Do you know the punishment
for a sinful tongue?

68
00:08:18,539 --> 00:08:22,001
Lifelong silence.

69
00:08:23,794 --> 00:08:26,506
Listen to me!

70
00:08:26,589 --> 00:08:28,716
The devil has come!

71
00:09:21,227 --> 00:09:23,771
My Lord, I won't take what's not mine.

72
00:09:23,854 --> 00:09:25,648
I will just take a look.

73
00:11:24,183 --> 00:11:27,353
I am certain that
the voice I heard was Clara's.

74
00:11:27,436 --> 00:11:28,896
Something is not right.

75
00:11:28,979 --> 00:11:31,899
My sister Clara hasn't written
to me for a long time.

76
00:11:31,982 --> 00:11:33,984
Whatever happened to her,

77
00:11:34,068 --> 00:11:35,778
this might be the reason.

78
00:11:35,861 --> 00:11:39,407
Sisters, can you accompany me
to look for my sister?

79
00:11:51,627 --> 00:11:53,546
I cannot force you.

80
00:11:53,629 --> 00:11:55,798
Sister, wait!

81
00:11:57,758 --> 00:11:59,718
It is time for dinner.

82
00:12:09,019 --> 00:12:10,563
Lastly,

83
00:12:11,439 --> 00:12:13,774
be strong in your fight

84
00:12:13,858 --> 00:12:17,820
so that you may be able
to fight the schemes of the devil

85
00:12:19,238 --> 00:12:22,283
because our enemies are not humans.

86
00:12:22,366 --> 00:12:24,493
Where is Sister Piedad?

87
00:12:24,577 --> 00:12:27,830
- I haven't seen her since vespers ended.
- But against the powers…

88
00:12:28,456 --> 00:12:33,586
The rulers of darkness
that exist in this world.

89
00:13:04,366 --> 00:13:05,242
Clara!

90
00:13:07,536 --> 00:13:09,163
Clara!

91
00:13:10,664 --> 00:13:12,917
Clara, what happened to you?
Why do you look like this?

92
00:13:13,000 --> 00:13:15,461
- What did they do to you?
- Sister Flor, please.

93
00:13:15,544 --> 00:13:19,173
The body is imprisoned,
but not the spirit.

94
00:13:20,341 --> 00:13:21,592
Who?

95
00:13:21,675 --> 00:13:22,885
Who, Clara?

96
00:13:23,761 --> 00:13:26,013
There are shadows…

97
00:13:26,096 --> 00:13:27,640
whispering.

98
00:13:27,723 --> 00:13:30,142
- Vow of silence!
- They are playing with us.

99
00:13:30,226 --> 00:13:33,437
Clara, what? What are you talking about?

100
00:13:34,021 --> 00:13:36,607
You are disturbing the peace
of the evening meal!

101
00:13:36,690 --> 00:13:37,858
Go back inside!

102
00:13:39,151 --> 00:13:41,153
What have you done to my sister?

103
00:13:41,904 --> 00:13:43,280
How barbaric!

104
00:13:43,364 --> 00:13:45,449
Are they hurting you?

105
00:13:45,533 --> 00:13:47,034
What are they doing to you?

106
00:13:47,117 --> 00:13:49,537
What are they making you drink?
Are they poisoning you?

107
00:13:49,620 --> 00:13:50,996
You are forbidden to eat tonight!

108
00:13:51,080 --> 00:13:53,207
- Clara!
- You are forbidden to eat tonight!

109
00:13:53,290 --> 00:13:56,418
Wait, I just want to speak
to my sister! Clara!

110
00:13:56,502 --> 00:13:57,753
Clara!

111
00:14:04,218 --> 00:14:06,595
Sister Piedad is still missing.

112
00:14:06,679 --> 00:14:07,888
I wonder where she is.

113
00:14:07,972 --> 00:14:11,725
Maybe she's in the chapel
or in the oratory.

114
00:14:41,797 --> 00:14:44,675
Does the darkness frighten you, sister?

115
00:14:46,510 --> 00:14:50,389
The thing you should fear more is
the punishment that awaits you.

116
00:14:56,186 --> 00:14:59,857
What have you done to my sister?
Let me out!

117
00:14:59,940 --> 00:15:02,776
Let me out of here!

118
00:15:05,487 --> 00:15:07,406
Clara!

119
00:15:07,489 --> 00:15:09,241
You need to learn.

120
00:15:09,325 --> 00:15:12,870
Following orders is the path to holiness.

121
00:15:30,888 --> 00:15:33,849
Clara, what will happen to me
when you leave?

122
00:15:36,602 --> 00:15:38,771
Who will be my strength?

123
00:15:40,105 --> 00:15:43,359
You don't need me to be strong, Flor.

124
00:15:44,234 --> 00:15:45,945
You're brave.

125
00:15:46,528 --> 00:15:49,365
You have your own inner strength.

126
00:15:50,532 --> 00:15:54,078
One day, you'll be
someone else’s strength.

127
00:16:02,920 --> 00:16:04,880
<i>Flor.</i>

128
00:16:04,964 --> 00:16:06,757
<i>Flor.</i>

129
00:16:46,505 --> 00:16:48,382
Bring someone with you.

130
00:16:48,465 --> 00:16:50,009
Bury her at the back.

131
00:16:50,092 --> 00:16:52,720
This may be what Sister Clara meant.

132
00:16:52,803 --> 00:16:55,681
- The devil is here!
- Be silent!

133
00:16:57,182 --> 00:16:59,601
No one should know about this.

134
00:17:00,644 --> 00:17:02,187
But Mother Juana?

135
00:17:02,271 --> 00:17:05,274
Clara's visions caused this.

136
00:17:05,357 --> 00:17:08,527
The devil is using her to frighten us.

137
00:17:08,610 --> 00:17:11,196
But we will not be defeated.

138
00:17:11,280 --> 00:17:13,490
We should pray harder.

139
00:17:14,283 --> 00:17:16,869
Yes, Mother Superior.

140
00:17:16,952 --> 00:17:20,164
Find someone to help you
bury Sister Piedad before dawn.

141
00:17:20,247 --> 00:17:22,124
- Hurry up!
- Yes, Mother Juana.

142
00:17:46,398 --> 00:17:47,858
<i>Juana.</i>

143
00:18:19,681 --> 00:18:26,063
Come here. Open this.

144
00:18:26,146 --> 00:18:28,148
Oh my God.

145
00:19:16,738 --> 00:19:19,575
Your brother's missing ship
has already been found.

146
00:19:19,658 --> 00:19:21,910
It's docked, and he's alive.

147
00:19:21,994 --> 00:19:23,954
Thank you very much, Sister Clara.

148
00:19:24,037 --> 00:19:26,373
Thank you very much.

149
00:19:30,335 --> 00:19:32,546
Sister Clara, my body is aching.

150
00:20:10,792 --> 00:20:12,419
Did you hear that?

151
00:20:12,502 --> 00:20:15,005
I think someone is following us.

152
00:20:15,797 --> 00:20:17,341
Do not speak of it.

153
00:20:17,424 --> 00:20:19,927
If you speak of it, it will become real.

154
00:20:21,553 --> 00:20:24,139
Do whatever you want.
I do not want trouble.

155
00:20:25,182 --> 00:20:26,350
Salve!

156
00:20:31,230 --> 00:20:33,106
What was that?

157
00:20:38,779 --> 00:20:40,280
Who broke it?

158
00:20:42,741 --> 00:20:44,201
It wasn't me.

159
00:20:53,919 --> 00:20:57,339
Was it you again, Sister Ana?

160
00:20:59,675 --> 00:21:01,343
It wasn't me.

161
00:21:01,885 --> 00:21:03,387
Clean it.

162
00:21:03,470 --> 00:21:05,097
Clean it!

163
00:21:05,180 --> 00:21:06,932
Use your mouth.

164
00:21:08,892 --> 00:21:10,227
What?

165
00:21:14,231 --> 00:21:16,566
What did you say?

166
00:21:16,650 --> 00:21:19,444
Do not make me repeat what I said.

167
00:21:19,528 --> 00:21:22,281
This is unjust!

168
00:21:23,323 --> 00:21:26,910
What do you know
about justice, Sister Flor?

169
00:21:30,622 --> 00:21:34,418
You are here to be molded.

170
00:21:34,501 --> 00:21:36,753
Not to ask questions.

171
00:21:55,939 --> 00:21:57,607
I will do it.

172
00:21:58,984 --> 00:22:00,569
I will do it.

173
00:22:02,029 --> 00:22:03,071
I will do it.

174
00:22:03,155 --> 00:22:04,614
I will do it.

175
00:22:19,504 --> 00:22:22,090
What are you hiding from us?

176
00:22:52,079 --> 00:22:55,540
I brought something
to get rid of the taste of soil.

177
00:23:00,962 --> 00:23:03,799
I am just celebrating the life
that was given to me.

178
00:23:05,592 --> 00:23:07,094
Is it your birthday, Sister Salve?

179
00:23:07,177 --> 00:23:08,470
Yes.

180
00:23:10,222 --> 00:23:12,474
Can I have some?

181
00:23:22,567 --> 00:23:24,027
Sister Flor?

182
00:23:28,031 --> 00:23:30,659
No, thank you.

183
00:23:31,243 --> 00:23:34,579
I hope you can find a way
to leave this place,

184
00:23:36,039 --> 00:23:39,417
and live the life you are dreaming of.

185
00:23:46,383 --> 00:23:49,302
I know Clara will not forsake me.

186
00:23:49,928 --> 00:23:51,888
I need to find her.

187
00:24:16,705 --> 00:24:17,831
Sister!

188
00:24:19,166 --> 00:24:20,417
Sister Flor!

189
00:24:20,500 --> 00:24:21,918
Sister Salve!

190
00:24:22,002 --> 00:24:23,587
Come here and look at this!

191
00:24:52,407 --> 00:24:54,993
They died one after another.

192
00:24:59,748 --> 00:25:02,042
Someone was just buried recently.

193
00:25:18,391 --> 00:25:20,435
They are here, Mother Superior!

194
00:25:49,631 --> 00:25:52,926
Not only did you steal from the kitchen,

195
00:25:53,009 --> 00:25:54,970
but you also went against the rule

196
00:25:55,053 --> 00:25:58,932
of not going to the back of the convent.

197
00:26:12,320 --> 00:26:13,989
Watch them.

198
00:26:14,698 --> 00:26:16,700
This is what will save you.

199
00:26:17,784 --> 00:26:21,955
This will remind you not to commit sin.

200
00:26:23,623 --> 00:26:26,584
This will cleanse your souls.

201
00:26:52,485 --> 00:26:56,031
Please take away, my Lord,

202
00:26:57,407 --> 00:27:00,076
what is troubling my spirit.

203
00:27:01,453 --> 00:27:03,872
They have sinned.

204
00:27:04,497 --> 00:27:06,624
They deserve to be punished.

205
00:27:07,208 --> 00:27:09,627
I am not the bad one.

206
00:27:57,384 --> 00:28:01,596
Is this my reward, O Lord?

207
00:29:44,741 --> 00:29:47,160
The eclipse will devour the moon.

208
00:29:47,243 --> 00:29:49,871
But the devil will eat the eclipse.

209
00:29:50,789 --> 00:29:53,708
Then he will reign over the world.

210
00:30:07,722 --> 00:30:10,350
Where did they take Rita's body?

211
00:30:14,604 --> 00:30:17,357
Maybe they already sent her back
to her family.

212
00:30:22,320 --> 00:30:24,823
Did she commit suicide because of us?

213
00:30:26,991 --> 00:30:28,535
She was weak.

214
00:30:30,578 --> 00:30:32,747
She couldn't handle the fact
that we were punished

215
00:30:32,831 --> 00:30:34,791
because she reported us.

216
00:30:49,848 --> 00:30:51,724
What was that?

217
00:31:02,777 --> 00:31:03,945
Let's get out of here!

218
00:31:11,244 --> 00:31:14,581
Wait! I'll join you in a bit.
I need to find my sister.

219
00:31:14,664 --> 00:31:16,124
Sister Flor!

220
00:31:16,708 --> 00:31:18,084
Come with me!

221
00:31:20,420 --> 00:31:21,880
Sister Salve?

222
00:31:23,339 --> 00:31:24,674
Where are you?

223
00:31:25,967 --> 00:31:28,553
Salve, don't leave me!

224
00:31:31,931 --> 00:31:33,433
Ana?

225
00:31:35,059 --> 00:31:36,686
Ana?

226
00:31:36,769 --> 00:31:39,439
Don't leave me here, Salve!

227
00:31:41,441 --> 00:31:42,984
Merciful God!

228
00:31:43,067 --> 00:31:45,236
Get inside! Return to your rooms!

229
00:31:45,320 --> 00:31:48,239
Lock the doors
and stay inside no matter what!

230
00:31:48,323 --> 00:31:50,366
Hurry! Over there!

231
00:32:04,088 --> 00:32:05,256
Clara, where are you?

232
00:32:07,175 --> 00:32:08,927
You will not survive!

233
00:32:09,010 --> 00:32:10,386
I am not afraid of you, Rita!

234
00:32:10,470 --> 00:32:12,347
There is no way out!

235
00:32:12,430 --> 00:32:13,473
You will not survive!

236
00:32:21,147 --> 00:32:23,983
Salve, don't leave me!

237
00:32:26,653 --> 00:32:28,071
Salve!

238
00:34:28,066 --> 00:34:29,609
Clara?

239
00:34:35,656 --> 00:34:37,075
Clara?

240
00:34:49,670 --> 00:34:50,755
Devil…

241
00:34:50,838 --> 00:34:52,882
The devil!

242
00:34:52,965 --> 00:34:55,259
The devil!

243
00:34:55,343 --> 00:34:57,178
Clara! Clara, this is me, Flor!

244
00:35:01,474 --> 00:35:04,435
Hail Mary, full of grace,
the Lord is with thee.

245
00:35:04,519 --> 00:35:06,896
Clara! Clara, it is me, Flor!

246
00:35:06,979 --> 00:35:08,564
Clara!

247
00:35:08,648 --> 00:35:12,985
Blessed art thou among women, and blessed
is the fruit of thy womb, Jesus…

248
00:35:20,326 --> 00:35:21,786
Clara.

249
00:35:26,457 --> 00:35:28,835
Flor?

250
00:35:28,918 --> 00:35:31,379
Forgive me.

251
00:35:32,296 --> 00:35:33,631
Clara.

252
00:35:33,714 --> 00:35:35,925
What did they do to you?

253
00:35:36,008 --> 00:35:38,177
What did Mother Juana do to you?

254
00:35:38,261 --> 00:35:41,013
We need to stop the evil one.

255
00:35:44,142 --> 00:35:46,352
What is happening?

256
00:35:53,067 --> 00:35:55,987
The only thing I know comes solely
from my visions.

257
00:35:56,863 --> 00:36:00,116
<i>A creature of darkness,</i>
<i>born into this world</i>

258
00:36:00,199 --> 00:36:02,869
<i>from a distant land</i>

259
00:36:02,952 --> 00:36:04,245
<i>as old as time.</i>

260
00:36:04,328 --> 00:36:06,080
<i>Cursed.</i>

261
00:36:06,164 --> 00:36:07,456
<i>It spread terror and death.</i>

262
00:36:07,540 --> 00:36:11,752
<i>Imprisoned by our family's ancestors</i>
<i>in a special chest.</i>

263
00:36:11,836 --> 00:36:14,630
<i>But its spirit remained free.</i>

264
00:36:14,714 --> 00:36:16,090
<i>Searching for sacrifices,</i>

265
00:36:16,174 --> 00:36:18,926
<i>using our weaknesses and fears.</i>

266
00:36:19,010 --> 00:36:21,721
<i>With every drop of blood,</i>
<i>and every soul consumed,</i>

267
00:36:21,804 --> 00:36:24,557
<i>it gains the strength to be freed</i>

268
00:36:24,640 --> 00:36:28,102
and eradicate humanity.

269
00:36:55,838 --> 00:36:57,256
The two of you!

270
00:36:58,299 --> 00:37:01,719
You are the ones
who brought the devil here!

271
00:37:01,802 --> 00:37:04,513
Servants of the devil!

272
00:37:04,597 --> 00:37:06,933
